WEBVTT

00:00:01.960 --> 00:00:02.980
Listening devices?

00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:06.650
Looks like they were spying on us, to learn of our movements.

00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:09.780
Who would do it? And when?

00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:11.530
Colin?

00:00:11.910 --> 00:00:14.960
He headed out to the backyard, saying he wanted to check it out, yes...

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:15.840
It's here!

00:00:16.630 --> 00:00:18.580
Colin is definitely the spy.

00:00:19.110 --> 00:00:22.110
I suspect he's already returned to her side.

00:00:22.110 --> 00:00:24.350
Then, that means...

00:00:32.490 --> 00:00:33.550
She's a psycho!

00:00:33.550 --> 00:00:35.220
She struck me like a total psycho!

00:00:36.040 --> 00:00:37.180
There's a lot of incorrect kanji...

00:00:38.110 --> 00:00:41.030
Did she say anything about her learning Japanese?

00:00:41.030 --> 00:00:42.390
Um...

00:00:42.390 --> 00:00:44.940
If I recall she said she studied it very hard.

00:00:45.320 --> 00:00:47.720
Then these mistakes must be on purpose.

00:00:47.720 --> 00:00:48.230
Yukitaka!

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:51.030
I need ten copies of each page!

00:00:51.030 --> 00:00:52.230
Oh, right!

00:00:57.350 --> 00:00:59.330
Go do it yourself!

00:01:06.170 --> 00:01:08.210
What kind of code?

00:01:08.210 --> 00:01:09.340
You'll find out soon.

00:01:10.060 --> 00:01:12.480
I've got plenty of listening devices.

00:01:12.480 --> 00:01:16.810
From ones I purposefully let you discover, to ones you'll never find.

00:01:23.220 --> 00:01:27.460
The towns entrance is adorned with a cow's skull

00:01:28.410 --> 00:01:31.810
It's fine that the law is decided by the strongest,

00:01:33.620 --> 00:01:37.380
But this simple feeling will not be enough to fulfill you

00:01:38.610 --> 00:01:43.030
Everyone will definitely revolt and shortly disappear

00:01:43.180 --> 00:01:48.160
That's a shocking bloody picture

00:01:48.160 --> 00:01:53.500
I'm feeling nauseous

00:01:53.500 --> 00:02:03.890
Holding my head, I board the subway

00:02:03.890 --> 00:02:14.060
Righteous way of living, righteous way of dying

00:02:14.060 --> 00:02:24.360
Who on earth knows or what the hell can show me?

00:02:31.810 --> 00:02:34.860
Cold finger girl

00:02:42.350 --> 00:02:43.980
Sit Down

00:02:57.200 --> 00:02:58.740
I'm finished over here.

00:03:00.030 --> 00:03:02.310
And when you connect all the characters?

00:03:02.310 --> 00:03:04.890
Rupachigatakahamirato.

00:03:04.890 --> 00:03:05.760
What the heck?

00:03:06.580 --> 00:03:09.830
So the characters themselves are meaningless...

00:03:11.380 --> 00:03:12.290
What is it?

00:03:13.020 --> 00:03:13.930
H-Hey...

00:03:21.220 --> 00:03:22.100
"Ma"!

00:03:22.100 --> 00:03:24.090
So that's how it works...

00:03:24.090 --> 00:03:24.840
Miho-chan!

00:03:24.840 --> 00:03:25.640
Got it!

00:03:28.040 --> 00:03:29.850
Underneath the perfectly round moon,

00:03:30.250 --> 00:03:34.050
I have prepared a fun quiz for you at the peak of Mt. Honeo.

00:03:34.050 --> 00:03:37.060
I'll be waiting for you at exactly 8 PM.

00:03:37.060 --> 00:03:38.790
A perfectly round moon.

00:03:38.790 --> 00:03:40.780
That would be the night of the 15th.

00:03:43.110 --> 00:03:46.200
As I suspected, it seems like all lines are being intercepted.

00:03:46.800 --> 00:03:50.460
We can't send a message to the mothership, let alone Planet Dogura.

00:03:51.020 --> 00:03:53.490
What about the spatial transference device in the forest?

00:03:53.490 --> 00:03:55.170
It would be a waste of time to even check.

00:03:55.910 --> 00:03:57.540
When did he?

00:03:57.540 --> 00:04:00.140
As there was nothing amiss the day before yesterday,

00:04:00.440 --> 00:04:02.970
it was probably back then.

00:04:03.460 --> 00:04:05.610
He didn't act that way at all!

00:04:05.610 --> 00:04:09.150
Well, we were not particularly on the lookout.

00:04:09.650 --> 00:04:11.800
Don't tell me we've been outwitted?

00:04:15.160 --> 00:04:18.090
This is yet another beautiful evolutionary example!

00:04:18.840 --> 00:04:21.630
You bastard! Don't you understand the situation we're in?

00:04:21.630 --> 00:04:25.460
Let us accept the reality we find ourselves in, and come up with a new plan!

00:04:25.460 --> 00:04:27.750
What are you acting so calm about, you bug freak?

00:04:28.200 --> 00:04:29.700
Sade is correct.

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:30.120
For now,

00:04:30.730 --> 00:04:34.030
I think it would be best to contact the Disckonians.

00:04:34.030 --> 00:04:35.230
The Disckonians?

00:04:36.080 --> 00:04:40.470
I see. They would have some way of contacting outside space.

00:04:41.090 --> 00:04:44.040
I have to bow my head to that old fart again?!

00:04:44.040 --> 00:04:46.320
Only if you don't want the prince to get married.

00:04:49.340 --> 00:04:52.380
Now, I think I've figured out something else.

00:04:52.380 --> 00:04:53.140
Like what?

00:04:53.570 --> 00:04:58.860
They must have predicted we would seek the help of the Disckonians to establish communications.

00:04:59.260 --> 00:05:02.450
They should be playing their hand somehow.

00:05:02.450 --> 00:05:05.120
So you made them go on a pointless errand just to test your theory?

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:07.370
Well, that's the most fun way.

00:05:07.370 --> 00:05:09.620
If I was your servant I'd really wanna kill you.

00:05:10.200 --> 00:05:15.380
Anyway, just, wow. I thought she was a bit more easygoing.

00:05:15.950 --> 00:05:19.050
It's probably simply that she is playing the role of a psycho.

00:05:19.430 --> 00:05:24.370
She put in that hidden code and made sure to cut off all my escape routes, after all.

00:05:25.860 --> 00:05:28.600
The question is, why would she go to such lengths?

00:05:28.600 --> 00:05:31.800
Isn't it because she's obsessed with you?

00:05:31.800 --> 00:05:33.230
T-That doesn't make me happy at all.

00:05:33.790 --> 00:05:35.380
Was she always like this?

00:05:35.380 --> 00:05:36.360
I don't know.

00:05:37.660 --> 00:05:43.660
I haven't even met my little brother since he was 13 in human years, let alone the Princess.

00:05:43.950 --> 00:05:46.420
You don't see each other much, do you?

00:05:46.420 --> 00:05:50.320
Well, it is the age when your personality goes through a lot of changes.

00:05:50.320 --> 00:05:52.060
He was unexpectedly pretty similar.

00:05:53.060 --> 00:05:53.920
No way!

00:05:53.920 --> 00:05:57.730
If that were true, he'd realize it. He's his actual older brother, you know-

00:05:56.700 --> 00:05:57.730
Wait.

00:06:01.410 --> 00:06:02.010
I see!

00:06:04.260 --> 00:06:07.000
Let me shake your hands! You guys rock.

00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:08.930
What's with you? Creepy...

00:06:09.420 --> 00:06:13.270
What you just talked about. The possibility they aren't who they say is very plausible!

00:06:13.940 --> 00:06:16.100
The Princess and the Prince are total impostors!

00:06:16.880 --> 00:06:18.630
Then who are they?

00:06:18.630 --> 00:06:20.070
The Magura Freedom Alliance.

00:06:20.070 --> 00:06:21.120
What the hell is that?

00:06:21.120 --> 00:06:23.610
Magura, that's the planet the Princess is from, right?

00:06:24.160 --> 00:06:24.990
Yes.

00:06:25.820 --> 00:06:33.230
There are those who hate that Magura is treated as a subordinate moon to Dogura.

00:06:34.140 --> 00:06:37.790
Their goal is to bring about a bloodless revolution to liberate planet Magura.

00:06:38.240 --> 00:06:43.660
So, they're like a resistance movement that aims for Magura's independence?

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:47.930
They want to attack the wedding ceremony as a demonstration of their power.

00:06:48.630 --> 00:06:51.770
Going to such lengths to disrupt it would not be out of the question.

00:06:52.130 --> 00:06:54.680
What does this have to do with them being fakes?

00:06:54.680 --> 00:06:56.830
They were replaced.

00:06:58.700 --> 00:07:02.290
They captured Mohan and Princess Luna on their way to Earth,

00:07:02.290 --> 00:07:06.700
and replaced them with two people disguised as the Prince and Princess.

00:07:07.060 --> 00:07:08.490
But, why?

00:07:08.690 --> 00:07:10.240
To force me to marry.

00:07:11.160 --> 00:07:12.740
To marry the fake.

00:07:15.180 --> 00:07:19.080
If the wife of the King of Dogura wishes for Magura to be liberated,

00:07:19.080 --> 00:07:21.150
then the King must accept that.

00:07:21.150 --> 00:07:24.560
And if that happens, planet Dogura's power will decline.

00:07:25.660 --> 00:07:26.930
That's it! Then I'll...

00:07:27.750 --> 00:07:28.780
What is it?

00:07:30.580 --> 00:07:32.240
Let's go out for a walk.

00:07:34.440 --> 00:07:35.860
How goes it?

00:07:35.860 --> 00:07:39.100
I'm surprised. He figured it out so quickly.

00:07:39.680 --> 00:07:42.780
Then, all the other plans have already...

00:07:42.780 --> 00:07:44.240
Probably.

00:07:49.180 --> 00:07:53.010
Hey, Prince Baka! You call this a "walk"?

00:07:53.010 --> 00:07:54.030
Whatever, look.

00:08:01.430 --> 00:08:03.560
This is what the Earth looks like right now.

00:08:07.980 --> 00:08:09.050
What is this?

00:08:09.530 --> 00:08:14.390
Most likely they're from planets who don't much like the great power planet Dogura has.

00:08:15.990 --> 00:08:18.280
Disckonians, the Macbac race.

00:08:18.280 --> 00:08:19.890
The Ellarians, as well.

00:08:20.280 --> 00:08:21.910
Disckonians, huh?

00:08:21.910 --> 00:08:23.520
Wait, then do you mean?

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:26.240
Yes. It's been worrying me for a while, now.

00:08:26.850 --> 00:08:31.270
How was I able to escape from my mothership and head to Earth so easily?

00:08:32.370 --> 00:08:37.080
Why was it that the Earth was placed under Dogurian observation by the Galactic Council?

00:08:37.370 --> 00:08:38.540
The Disckonians,

00:08:38.840 --> 00:08:40.010
the Macbac race

00:08:40.210 --> 00:08:42.980
and the planet Calvary.

00:08:44.410 --> 00:08:48.580
They all wanted to tie me down here on Earth.

00:08:48.580 --> 00:08:51.260
Because if I had returned to Dogura, I'd be out of their reach.

00:08:51.570 --> 00:08:52.420
No way.

00:08:52.420 --> 00:08:58.080
Then you're saying everything that's happened was because of the Magura Freedom Alliance?

00:08:58.180 --> 00:09:00.380
They've really outdone themselves.

00:09:00.380 --> 00:09:02.980
They've studied me quite well.

00:09:07.950 --> 00:09:10.300
In that case, then Craft-san and Sade-san must be...

00:09:12.310 --> 00:09:16.580
Look, we just came to ask for your assistance, so...

00:09:16.580 --> 00:09:19.590
Sorry. Don't think ill of me.

00:09:19.590 --> 00:09:21.420
Ooh, it's been a while!

00:09:25.180 --> 00:09:26.040
C-Captain?

00:09:30.060 --> 00:09:31.510
I've seen through you! I've seen through you!

00:09:31.510 --> 00:09:32.830
All of you!

00:09:32.830 --> 00:09:35.890
You teamed up with Baka again, didn't you?!

00:09:37.320 --> 00:09:39.270
Well, that ain't gonna work twice!

00:09:39.270 --> 00:09:43.220
Sade, there's nothing to fear! All of them are acting!

00:09:44.520 --> 00:09:47.940
Finally, I've outsmarted that Baka, damn him!

00:09:47.940 --> 00:09:49.920
This time <i>I</i> predicted above the diagonal!

00:09:49.920 --> 00:09:52.250
So basically, you ain't gonna do nothin'!

00:09:55.380 --> 00:09:56.500
Do it.

00:10:01.960 --> 00:10:03.000
Craft-san.

00:10:09.770 --> 00:10:10.570
Now then...

00:10:10.570 --> 00:10:11.920
That's it?!

00:10:11.920 --> 00:10:15.840
We have to think. At this rate, the Earth will be lost.

00:10:16.210 --> 00:10:16.830
Huh?

00:10:16.830 --> 00:10:18.760
The Earth will be lost?

00:10:19.620 --> 00:10:22.970
Likely, they are insurance, in case their cover is blown.

00:10:22.970 --> 00:10:24.020
Insurance?

00:10:24.670 --> 00:10:29.350
They plan to threaten to destroy the Earth if I don't get married.

00:10:29.350 --> 00:10:33.050
But that's... I thought their goal was a bloodless revolution!

00:10:33.050 --> 00:10:38.540
Of course. But it's quite possible that another planet will attack against their will.

00:10:39.660 --> 00:10:40.450
Accidentally.

00:10:42.360 --> 00:10:43.460
That's underhanded.

00:10:43.460 --> 00:10:44.250
What are you going to do?

00:10:44.750 --> 00:10:51.030
The first thing I need to do is lure her into a conversation where she reveals she's an impostor.

00:10:51.030 --> 00:10:52.030
Can you do it?

00:10:52.030 --> 00:10:53.460
I'll set her up.

00:10:54.280 --> 00:10:58.300
I'm pretty sure the real Princess had moles on her right shoulder.

00:10:58.300 --> 00:11:01.470
Two of them, just like Dogura and Magura.

00:11:01.930 --> 00:11:06.400
I suspect that even the real princess wouldn't realize that I've noticed.

00:11:16.980 --> 00:11:17.940
Here you go.

00:11:21.320 --> 00:11:23.520
Let's have an early celebration, you two!

00:11:23.520 --> 00:11:26.140
We'll drink ourselves silly tonight!

00:11:38.370 --> 00:11:40.410
Prince Mohan! Princess Luna!

00:11:40.410 --> 00:11:41.800
Why are they...?

00:11:42.190 --> 00:11:43.780
Captain, that's...

00:11:46.130 --> 00:11:47.840
The Magura Freedom Alliance!

00:11:47.840 --> 00:11:49.090
Exactly.

00:12:14.210 --> 00:12:16.240
Shit!

00:12:16.240 --> 00:12:17.140
Are you finished yet?

00:12:17.140 --> 00:12:18.190
Just a little longer.

00:12:19.260 --> 00:12:25.950
It seems like they didn't research the fact that  secretions from insects on Earth can erode metal.

00:12:27.510 --> 00:12:28.780
One week.

00:12:29.420 --> 00:12:32.000
In about one week, we'll free you.

00:12:32.550 --> 00:12:36.370
A new world will be awaiting you.

00:12:39.610 --> 00:12:42.390
Screw that bitch.

00:12:47.890 --> 00:12:49.060
The fools!

00:12:49.060 --> 00:12:52.390
This is Mohan's ship! I know it like the back of my hand!

00:12:53.020 --> 00:12:55.930
Um... Please don't forget me.

00:12:59.880 --> 00:13:00.410
Prince Mohan!

00:13:00.800 --> 00:13:01.750
Craft.

00:13:01.750 --> 00:13:03.820
Princess Luna! Everything will be fine now.

00:13:07.090 --> 00:13:09.410
Will the two of them be okay?

00:13:11.410 --> 00:13:12.670
Don't move!

00:13:12.670 --> 00:13:14.620
C-Captain?!

00:13:15.830 --> 00:13:16.940
I wanna pull the trigger!

00:13:16.940 --> 00:13:19.090
After we get him to reveal the truth.

00:13:26.900 --> 00:13:30.510
That's surprising of you, Brother. Precisely on time.

00:13:30.510 --> 00:13:33.570
I have something I have to make sure of.

00:13:33.570 --> 00:13:34.830
What is that?

00:13:35.970 --> 00:13:39.180
I am not convinced that the two of you are who you say you are.

00:13:39.180 --> 00:13:41.700
Brother! That is inexcusably rud-

00:13:41.700 --> 00:13:42.530
Fine.

00:13:45.580 --> 00:13:48.150
How shall I prove it to you?

00:13:48.580 --> 00:13:52.000
The real Princess should have moles on her shoulder.

00:13:52.000 --> 00:13:53.130
Will you show me?

00:13:55.430 --> 00:13:57.270
How did you know?

00:13:57.270 --> 00:14:00.960
It was also a daily habit of mine to view your photo messages, Princess.

00:14:01.400 --> 00:14:05.840
On just one of the photos, I saw them pictured there.

00:14:07.610 --> 00:14:08.870
I understand.

00:14:17.420 --> 00:14:20.810
Will you believe me now?

00:14:22.880 --> 00:14:25.460
Yes, I believe.

00:14:26.230 --> 00:14:28.930
I believe I was correct, and you are not the real Princess.

00:14:30.030 --> 00:14:32.280
You're a freedom fighter of the Magura Freedom Alliance, aren't you?

00:14:33.950 --> 00:14:36.900
She had three moles, not two.

00:14:37.560 --> 00:14:40.720
I realized that you were listening to me then.

00:14:41.490 --> 00:14:44.330
I said it, remember? That I'd try setting you up.

00:14:46.150 --> 00:14:50.110
The reason you didn't confirm it on the real Princess you'd captured,

00:14:50.110 --> 00:14:53.530
was to keep to the Magura Freedom Alliance's pledge of non-violent revolution.

00:14:54.050 --> 00:14:58.010
The Princess cannot be made to show her skin to anyone other than her betrothed.

00:14:58.010 --> 00:15:01.310
If you forced her, it was possible she would harm herself.

00:15:01.810 --> 00:15:03.360
You knew all this?

00:15:03.360 --> 00:15:05.940
I should have noticed it sooner.

00:15:05.940 --> 00:15:07.810
You said it back at the start.

00:15:09.240 --> 00:15:12.590
"Between the two planets, Dogura and Magura..."

00:15:13.440 --> 00:15:16.550
It's characteristic of the Magura Freedom Alliance

00:15:16.550 --> 00:15:18.650
to refer to Magura as a planet, and not a moon.

00:15:20.170 --> 00:15:23.150
Even so, you two were quite excellent.

00:15:23.150 --> 00:15:24.710
Especially you, who played Mohan.

00:15:25.130 --> 00:15:28.260
The way you turned your face aside when the Princess showed me her skin.

00:15:28.260 --> 00:15:30.390
Your performance was perfect down to the last detail, excellent!

00:15:32.680 --> 00:15:35.000
Stop! I will not have you do something so dangerous!

00:15:35.000 --> 00:15:37.010
If we let this chance go by, we'll never get it again!

00:15:37.280 --> 00:15:40.770
The goal of the Magura Freedom Alliance is a bloodless revolution and liberation, and nothing more!

00:15:41.160 --> 00:15:43.570
Do you know how many years this took?

00:15:43.570 --> 00:15:45.100
We're not going to get another wedding!

00:15:45.640 --> 00:15:48.840
So we'll kill him, and free Magura!

00:15:50.920 --> 00:15:51.200
Don't!

00:16:02.560 --> 00:16:04.640
Your swordsmanship is far too simplistic.

00:16:05.310 --> 00:16:07.770
That's even weaker than Craft when he's trying to kill me.

00:16:07.770 --> 00:16:09.040
You can't hit me.

00:16:38.100 --> 00:16:39.350
No way...

00:16:40.880 --> 00:16:42.030
Don't move!

00:16:44.780 --> 00:16:46.830
Playtime is over!

00:17:03.750 --> 00:17:05.480
Good work, Mohan.

00:17:05.480 --> 00:17:07.600
Brother! I'm very sorry.

00:17:08.260 --> 00:17:12.250
It's because I forced the Princess to come with me that this happened.

00:17:13.170 --> 00:17:17.400
No, it is my fault! Even though I knew you were avoiding it,

00:17:17.650 --> 00:17:20.610
I couldn't forget you, and still wanted to get married!

00:17:20.610 --> 00:17:21.640
No, I'm the one at fault!

00:17:21.640 --> 00:17:24.870
I knew it, I can't stand these two.

00:17:25.330 --> 00:17:28.540
Aren't you forgetting something important, Prince?

00:17:28.540 --> 00:17:29.750
The fun quiz?

00:17:30.230 --> 00:17:31.500
Exactly.

00:17:32.200 --> 00:17:37.260
The Princess's ring, of which there is only one in the universe, has been stolen by thieves.

00:17:37.770 --> 00:17:40.680
The ring, once put on, can never be taken off the rest of your life.

00:17:41.990 --> 00:17:45.390
Without this, you can never marry the Princess.

00:17:45.840 --> 00:17:49.020
If you were the bridegroom, what would you do?

00:17:50.060 --> 00:17:50.520
Princess!

00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:54.250
You bastard! Don't you realize how sacred a thing that is?!

00:17:54.250 --> 00:17:56.120
If I didn't, I wouldn't be doing this!

00:17:57.050 --> 00:18:02.320
This flimsy, dinky knot demeans all we citizens of Magura!

00:18:03.850 --> 00:18:04.910
Now, answer me!

00:18:05.250 --> 00:18:07.620
You should have had plenty of time to think!

00:18:08.180 --> 00:18:09.050
Answer me!

00:18:10.970 --> 00:18:12.520
Yes...

00:18:18.110 --> 00:18:20.050
There is only one answer.

00:18:32.950 --> 00:18:34.560
I'll marry the thief.

00:18:41.640 --> 00:18:42.360
Captain!

00:18:42.360 --> 00:18:44.900
He went even higher above than I thought!

00:18:44.900 --> 00:18:48.250
A King and a revolutionary! Kind of has a ring to it.

00:18:48.250 --> 00:18:52.270
Much more "dangerous" than some Princess raised in a glass house.

00:18:53.530 --> 00:18:55.530
You are quite promising.

00:18:55.530 --> 00:18:57.140
You rock, seriously.

00:18:57.890 --> 00:19:01.430
First, we will begin by overthrowing the current dynasty!

00:19:05.950 --> 00:19:10.830
Then we'll prepare and raise a nightmarish kid who'll go on to become my arch-rival!

00:19:11.860 --> 00:19:13.910
We'll need an adviser for that.

00:19:14.540 --> 00:19:16.370
I leave the affairs of state to you, Brother!

00:19:16.370 --> 00:19:18.610
Or wait, the real one is over there.

00:19:19.280 --> 00:19:23.360
Nope. The real one is over there, Prince.

00:19:26.500 --> 00:19:32.570
I never guessed you would actually put the ring on yourself, Brother.

00:19:32.570 --> 00:19:35.000
Our plan was a complete failure.

00:19:35.380 --> 00:19:37.260
W-What do you mean?

00:19:37.260 --> 00:19:40.010
What he means is that the ones they captured were the fakes,

00:19:40.010 --> 00:19:43.750
and the one the Prince married is the real Luna!

00:19:43.750 --> 00:19:48.630
I was just obeying the orders of the real Prince and Princess the whole time!

00:19:48.630 --> 00:19:54.640
Yes, it's true. We attacked the ship trying to replace them.

00:19:56.060 --> 00:20:00.230
But it backfired, and our plan was ruined.

00:20:00.230 --> 00:20:01.420
I see!

00:20:02.800 --> 00:20:05.510
Then, I have a great idea!

00:20:07.160 --> 00:20:12.210
If she was just any old princess, I wouldn't have gone along with the act.

00:20:13.530 --> 00:20:19.290
But she played the part of the psycho, and convinced everyone, and did the quiz all by herself.

00:20:19.290 --> 00:20:20.540
She's pretty amazing.

00:20:21.050 --> 00:20:24.630
The woman you chose to marry wasn't in error.

00:20:26.430 --> 00:20:28.720
I covered up one of the moles with powder.

00:20:29.150 --> 00:20:35.730
When I heard you'd remembered them, I was so overjoyed I thought I might go crazy for real!

00:20:39.050 --> 00:20:41.570
I know that I'm a strange woman, but for better or worse,

00:20:42.170 --> 00:20:44.130
I'm glad to be with you.

00:20:59.530 --> 00:21:01.380
What!?

00:21:02.240 --> 00:21:04.030
That's a violation of galactic regulations!

00:21:04.030 --> 00:21:08.090
No. Princess Luna convinced them to allow this planet to graduate.

00:21:08.710 --> 00:21:10.260
From observation, that is.

00:21:14.910 --> 00:21:16.230
Fascinating.

00:21:17.570 --> 00:21:23.070
Right now, there are hundreds of alien species coming and going, living their lives on Earth.

00:21:23.770 --> 00:21:25.320
Species that come in peace.

00:21:25.320 --> 00:21:27.290
Aggressive, warlike species.

00:21:27.290 --> 00:21:29.930
Species on the brink of extinction.

00:21:29.930 --> 00:21:33.540
All kinds of alien species, from the level of international intrigue,

00:21:33.540 --> 00:21:38.480
to individual crimes, to research, all with a kaleidoscope of different goals.

00:21:38.480 --> 00:21:41.810
They coexist with us, and maintain a precarious balance.

00:21:43.850 --> 00:21:48.630
And it seems like the humans have finally realized this.

00:21:58.590 --> 00:21:59.330
Are you ready?

00:21:59.620 --> 00:22:10.130
Do not fear 'The Now' searching for something that can't be seen across this infinite distance

00:22:10.130 --> 00:22:24.350
Under the hundred million glittering lights, I found you searching for your dream

00:22:24.350 --> 00:22:33.110
An infinite world filled with glass shards

00:22:34.280 --> 00:22:45.170
Growing up I felt I knew many meaningless things

00:22:45.170 --> 00:22:52.630
Shining like a jewel, you soar in the sky, no past, no future

00:22:52.630 --> 00:22:57.970
The answer is beyond the sky

00:22:57.970 --> 00:23:08.480
Do not fear 'The Dream', in a distant
place where truth and lies are unseen

00:23:08.480 --> 00:23:24.210
Under the hundred million glittering lights, flowers sway in the wind

00:23:32.370 --> 00:23:33.550
Do your best!

00:23:34.090 --> 00:23:35.200
Hey!

00:23:44.200 --> 00:23:46.880
I believe this is called a "cat".

00:23:46.880 --> 00:23:48.300
This'll do.
